50:An Otherworldly Encounter
51:Kirito
52:...That reminds me – what is this place?
54:Wait, wait, wait...
56:So, this is actually...
57:You mean, you don't know what's going on either? Oh well, I was only just summoned here out of nowhere myself.
58:Summoned out of nowhere?
59:Yeah. A hidden monster-slaying quest popped up on my screen. Just when I hit "Accept," I saw this blinding flash of light. When I came to my senses again, I was here.
60:...Strange. This isn't some sort of bug, is it?
61:Ichihime
62:Kirito, please help us, nyaa!
63:Sure. I accepted the quest, so I intend to see it through. But first things first – let's take stock of the situation.
65:We're counting on you, Kirito.
66:Leave it to me. The streets aren't safe right now, we'd better hurry...
67:Huh...?! {var:player_nickname}, Ichihime! Watch out!
68:Nyaa nyaa nyaaaa?!
69:Kirito suddenly lunges forward with a swing of his sword to block an incoming arrow.
70:These monsters have ranged attacks, too?!
71:Monsters
72:ROOOAAAR!
73:Oh no, nyaa...! We're surrounded, there's no way we can make a run for it now, nyaa...
74:That big dark one looks tough! Are you sure you'll be okay on your own, Kirito, nyaa?!
75:Who said I was on my own?
76:Asuna! Switch!
77:Asuna
78:Hyaaaah!!
79:Grrurgh...!
